08D5|                       ;***** Comparisons of complex things
08D5|                         
08D5|                       ; Beware that many comparisons work only because compiler restricts you
08D5|                       ;   to = and <> on certain types.
08D5|                       ; The opcode tells what relation is being tested
08D5|                       ;   the next byte indicates the type of the things being compared
08D5|                       ;   if arrays are being compared, the next GBDE is the array size
08D5|                       ; Tests allowed...
08D5|                       ; Boolean:  all relations.  stuff is on the stack.
08D5|                       ; Real:             all relations.  stuff is on the stack.
08D5|                       ; Set:      =, <>, <= (subset), >= (superset).  stuff is on the stack.
08D5|                       ; String:   all relations. pointers to stuff are on stack.
08D5|                       ; Arrays and records:   =, <>. pointers to stuff on stack
08D5|                       ;
08D5|                       ;  after CSETUP flags are result of a-b.
